**/bin/
**/obj/
**/[Dd]ebug/
**/[Rr]elease/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.useroptions
*.gpState
*.log
_ReSharper*/
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
TestResults/
*.launchSettings.json

